This thesis studies deep learning methods for bovine embryo viability assessment using full-development time-lapse videos. It presents dataset preparation, annotation design, and benchmark experiments across CNN-RNN, 3D-CNN, and video transformer architectures, highlighting the challenges of long-horizon biological video understanding under limited-data conditions.
